[en.FOCUS_C08_WINTER_WARM_UP]
Winter Wrap Up

[en.FOCUS_C08_WINTER_WARM_UP_desc]
The Winter has gone, and the Spring has come. Starlight and the Resistance have prepared to march into the new year.\nThe so-called “Equestria Empire” was born in suffering and sorrow, and will be destroyed in the anger of the Resistance.\nJust like the melting snow, only the demise of the illegal empire can truly bring Equestria back into her own Spring!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_WINTER_WARM_UP]
送冬迎春

[zh.FOCUS_C08_WINTER_WARM_UP_desc]
冬天已去，春天以来。星光熠熠与抵抗军已经做好了向新一年进发的准备。\n所谓的“小马利亚帝国”诞生于苦难与悲痛之中，终将灭亡于抵抗军的怒火中。\n一如那融化的冬雪，只有伪帝国的消亡，才能让小马利亚真正迎来属于她的春天！

